<div class="ed-reading guide-reading text-lg">
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">After a transfer, check the new phone or tablet with representative content before making any decision about the old device. Open an older and a recent photo, inspect a contact and calendar entry, review a message and open a local file. Check app content rather than only the app icon. Keep the old device available while downloads, account access, authenticator setup and provider steps are still unresolved.</p>
<section class="ed-start" id="start" aria-labelledby="start-heading"><p class="ed-label">Start here</p><h2 id="start-heading">Verify representative content</h2><p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Record what you observed, what remains pending and who owns the next step.</p><div class="ed-choices">
